                   {5{LW}}           & `MEM_LW     |
                   {5{LBU}}          & `MEM_LBU    |
                   {5{LHU}}          & `MEM_LHU    |
                   {5{SB}}           & `MEM_SB     |
                   {5{SH}}           & `MEM_SH     |
                   {5{SW}}           & `MEM_SW     |
